      lines:
        'M20 10.5 29.5 27 10.5 27zM20 10.5 20 1.5M20 10.5 36 10.8M20 10.5 4 10.8M29.5 27 36 29.2M29.5 27 36 10.8M29.5 27 20 38.5M10.5 27 4 29.2M10.5 27 20 38.5M10.5 27 4 10.8',
